  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4ec6efbfa68f4e3baa6242c9654dbc2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueSet1:
  - NED is a 13-year old boy who loves Video Games! (press ENTER)
  - "NED is extremely excited for the nearby Video Game Store\u2019s Grand Opening!
    Help NED get to the store!!"
  dialogueSet2:
  - THE STORE OWNER cast a spell on NED, and something strange happened! (press ENTER)
  - "NED had no idea why, but he felt his body shift\u2026into something more \u201CRetro\u201D...\n\n"
  - "NED opened his eyes, and looked around\u2026he was in ANCIENT MESOPOTAMIA!\n\n"
  - Help NED get back to the present day!
  dialogueSet3:
  - After GILGAMESH surrendered, NED felt exhausted. On the ground, he picked up
    new items! (press ENTER)
  - 'His BAT was replaced with a MACE (press X to use), and his SLINGSHOT a JAVELIN
    (press Z to use).

'
  - "NED now woke up in the DARK AGES, and felt like his time period was \u201Cin
    another castle!\u201D"
  dialogueSet4:
  - After LANCELOT surrendered, NED spotted some new tools. Excited, he ran towards
    them and obtained them. (press ENTER)
  - 'His MACE was replaced with a SWORD (press X to use), and his JAVELIN a CROSSBOW
    (press Z to use).

'
  - 'NED was moved through time again and found himself in COLONIAL AMERICA. He felt
    like he was almost back to the present! '
  dialogueSet5:
  - KING GEORGE & GEORGE WASHINGTON surrendered and gave their items to NED. (press
    ENTER)
  - 'His SWORD was replaced with a MUSKET BLADE (press X to use), and his CROSSBOW
    a MUSKET BULLET (press Z to use).

'
  - 'After making his way through around 5,000 YEARS in History, NED found himself
    back in the present.

'
  - 'His body shifted back into something less RETRO, and more normal. He woke up
    near the same store he was sent back in time by: THE RETRO ROOM.'
  - Angry, NED confronted the owner...
  dialogueSet6:
  - NED had now defeated the TIMEKEEPER and successfully returned to the PRESENT!
    (press ENTER)
  - His journey complete, he learned that patience is an important virtue!
  dialogueObjects:
  - {fileID: 1992574347}
  - {fileID: 389228277}
  - {fileID: 289408981}
